# Keep the build context small and free of host state/secrets (ARCH-DEVENV-SECRETS).
# Host node_modules (pnpm symlinks) and dist must never overwrite what the image installs/builds.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.tanstack
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.reqaml
docker-data
screenshots
artifacts
*.log
